@startuml AD-03c_DomainExpert_CheckAssessorReliability
title AD-03c · Domain Expert — check AI grading reliability

|Domain Expert|
|System|
|AI Model|

|Domain Expert|
start
:Open reference samples;
|System|
:Hide other scores;
:Show reference samples;
|Domain Expert|
repeat
  :View sample;
  :Rate sample blind;
repeat while () is ([more samples]) not ([all rated])
:Submit blind ratings;
|System|
:Save blind ratings;
:Calculate expert agreement;
:Send samples to AI;
|AI Model|
:Regrade all samples;
|System|
:Compare AI, expert scores;
:Show agreement report;
|Domain Expert|
:View agreement report;
while () is ([disagreement left])
  :Inspect disagreement;
endwhile ([none left])
if () then ([rubric needs changing])
  :Request replacement;
  |System|
  :Notify content admin; <<sendSignal>>
  :Show request status;
  |Domain Expert|
  :View request status;
else ([rubric fine])
endif
stop
@enduml
